    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22007" root="شر" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَارٌ</span></b> , (S, A, O, Msb, TA,) accord. to the K
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرَارٌ</span>, but this is a mistake, (MF,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَرٌ</span></b> , (S,
A, O, Msb, K,) which is a contraction of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَارٌ</span>,
(Msb,) <i>Sparks of fire:</i> (S, O, Msb, K:) n. un.
of each with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (S, A, O, Msb, * K.) See an ex.
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرَّارٌ</span>.

